      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's good to hear. I'll use that for the summary. \n\nJust one quick follow-up for my own peace of mind: our internal teams have been raising some flags about the legacy authentication module—specifically regarding how it handles session tokens. Does that specific module fall under the \"no critical vulnerabilities\" category you just mentioned, or is it something we should be keeping an eye on?",
